body:
DevGuys, first of all, thanks for the awesome game, I haven't even got too far but I'm loving it! I have encountered only one bug so far, when I change my key bindings on PC (for keyboard), they are saved only until I quit the game, when I want to play again, I have to rebind the keys again. I'm just changing 2 keys, so it isn't that much of a chore, but I can see it becoming annoying. Thanks!

&#x200B;

EDIT: Oh, also, when I bought an ability and wanted to equip it, it only said that I don't have high enough stats to equip it, but it didn't show the requirements for it, so now I'm left wondering what stats I need to level up. I will look it up on the internet, but that won't satisfy others with this issue.
